<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
  <data noupdate="0">
    <record id="bill_expire_warn_mail" model="mail.template">
      <field name="name">订单管理：账单到期提醒</field>
      <!-- <field name="model_id" ref="base.model_res_users"/> -->
      <field name="model_id" ref="ifs_gar_trade.model_ifs_gar_trade_order"/>
      <field name="subject">鸥贝云账单到期提醒</field>
      <field name="email_from">"{{ object.factor_id.name }}" &lt;{{ object.factor_id.email }}&gt;</field>
      <field name="email_to">"{{ object.merchant_id.name }}" &lt;{{ object.merchant_id.root_employee_id.sudo().user_id.email_formatted }}&gt;</field>
      <field name="lang">{{ object.lang }}</field>
      <field name="auto_delete" eval="True"/>
      <field name="body_html" type="html">

        <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="padding-top: 16px; background-color: #F1F1F1; font-family:Verdana, Arial,sans-serif; color: #454748; width: 100%; border-collapse:separate;">
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td align="center">
                <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="590" style="padding: 16px; background-color: white; color: #454748; border-collapse:separate;">
                  <tbody>
                    <!-- HEADER -->
                    <tr>
                      <td style="min-width: 590px;">
                        <p style="margin:0px 0 12px 0;box-sizing:border-box;">
                        致                        <br />
                          <t t-out="object.merchant_id.name" data-oe-t-inline="true" contenteditable="false" oe-keep-contenteditable="">
                          ***********有限公司</t>，                        <t t-out="object.merchant_id.root_employee_id.sudo().user_id.name" data-oe-t-inline="true" contenteditable="false" oe-keep-contenteditable="">***</t>
                          <br />


                        </p>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td colspan="2" style="text-align:center;">
                        <hr width="100%" style="background-color:rgb(204,204,204);border:medium none;clear:both;display:block;font-size:0px;min-height:1px;line-height:0; margin:16px 0px 16px 0px;" contenteditable="false"/>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <!-- CONTENT -->
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <div class="clause">
                          <p>您在<t t-out="object.carete_date" contenteditable="false" data-oe-t-inline="true" oe-keep-contenteditable="">xx年xx月xx日</t>与深圳市友电物联科技有限公司形成的一笔采购订单，按照您与我方签订的应付账款转让确认书（编号：<t t-out="object.t20_contract_info_id.code" contenteditable="false" data-oe-t-inline="true" oe-keep-contenteditable="">NA</t>），您需在
                          <t t-out="object.repayment_date" contenteditable="false" data-oe-t-inline="true" oe-keep-contenteditable="">xx年xx月xx日</t>前，偿还我方人民币<t t-out="object.withdrawal_amount" style="font-size:16px; font-weight: 700" contenteditable="false" data-oe-t-inline="true" oe-keep-contenteditable="">XXX</t>元（大写人民币：<t t-out="object.withdrawal_amount_uppercase" contenteditable="false" data-oe-t-inline="true" oe-keep-contenteditable="">XXX</t>）；</p>
                          <p>我方收款账户信息如下：</p>
                          <p>开户行：              <t t-out="object.deposit_bank"></t></p>
                          <p>账户名：             <t t-out="object.account_name"></t></p>
                          <p>账号：              <t t-out="object.account_no"></t></p>
                          <p>备注：              <t t-out="object.merchant_id.name"></t>还款</p>
                        </div>
                        <p style="margin-top: 30px">提示信息：</p>
                        <ol>
                          <li>转账时，请务必填写上面的“备注”信息，以便我方账务核实款项来源；</li>
                          <li>请在转款完成后，进入应收保系统，点击“还款“，发起还款确认流程，并上传转款凭证截图；我方在确认收到款项后，出具《结清证明》，并即刻恢复您的可用额度。</li>
                        </ol>
                        <p>应收保登入域名: https://cloud.oabay.com</p>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td colspan="2" style="text-align:center;">
                        <hr width="100%" style="background-color:rgb(204,204,204);border:medium none;clear:both;display:block;font-size:0px;min-height:1px;line-height:0; margin:16px 0px 16px 0px;" contenteditable="false"/>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <!-- FOOTER -->
                    <tr>
                      <td align="center" style="min-width: 590px;">
                        <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="590" style="min-width: 590px; background-color: white; font-size: 11px; padding: 0px 8px 0px 8px; border-collapse:separate;">
                          <tbody>
                            <tr>
                              <td>
                                <img style="width: 45%;margin-left:-15px;" src="/ifs_gar_repayment/static/description/logo.png" alt="logo"/>
                              </td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                              <td valign="middle" align="left">
                              鸥贝云信用科技（深圳）有限公司
                              </td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                              <td valign="middle" align="left" style="opacity: 0.7;">
                              +755 2511-9601 | cloud@mail.oabay.com | https://cloud.oabay.com
                              </td>
                            </tr>
                          </tbody>
                        </table>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                  </tbody>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <!-- POWERED BY -->
            <tr>
              <td align="center" style="min-width: 590px;">
                <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="590" style="min-width: 590px; background-color: #F1F1F1; color: #454748; padding: 8px; border-collapse:separate;">
                  <tbody>
                    <tr>
                      <td style="text-align: center; font-size: 13px;">
                      由                      <a target="_blank" href="https://www.lifewiz.cn" style="color: #875A7B;">云腾智慧</a>提供技术支持
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                  </tbody>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>

      </field>
    </record>
  </data>
</odoo>